e inferred from the source rather than established by measurement. Likely costs include repeated graph/matrix copies, dense adjacency storage and initialization, repeated Prim/partition work, and recursive path-search scans and copies. The target is ARM64 with 4 cores; given the small measured runtime and no profile, prioritize isolated, semantics-preserving changes and measured end-to-end comparisons rather than assuming parallelism or additive gains.\"}"}}
